    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Events"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A unique venue",
      "html": "<strong>A unique venue </strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "with a touching atmosphere!",
      "html": "<strong>with a touching atmosphere!</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Underwater Observatory Park is the perfect venue for your next event.",
      "html": "The Underwater Observatory Park is the perfect venue for your next event."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We have a range of options and can tailor to your precise needs, all whilst added a stunning 100% natural backdrop!",
      "html": "We have a range of options and can tailor to your precise needs,<br> all whilst added a stunning 100% natural backdrop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "With awesome Red Sea panoramic views, you will remember these events for a lifetime!",
      "html": "With awesome Red Sea panoramic views, you will remember these events for a lifetime!"
    },
    {
      "type": "iframe",
      "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/3VDHMru5pW0",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Predator Pyjama Party",
      "html": "<strong>Predator Pyjama Party</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "At the Underwater Observatory Marine Park, we believe that a friendly encounter with sharks and other marine creatures allows children, from an early age, to develop empathy with animals, create a bond and remove any fears.",
      "html": "At the Underwater Observatory Marine Park, we believe that a friendly encounter with sharks and other marine creatures allows children, from an early age, to develop empathy with animals, create a bond and remove any fears."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Enjoy a special night full of adventure, surprises, games and activities.",
      "html": "Enjoy a special night full of adventure, surprises, games and activities."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Celebrate a Birthday at Shark World",
      "html": "<strong>Celebrate a Birthday at Shark World</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Have a completely unique birthday party in the largest Shark pool in the Middle East.",
      "html": "Have a completely unique birthday party in the largest Shark pool in the Middle East."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Make it a birthday to remember with a guided tour of Shark World and games and activities tailored to suit the age of participating children.",
      "html": "Make it a birthday to remember with a guided tour of Shark World and games and activities tailored to suit the age of participating children."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Suitable for up to 40 participants.",
      "html": "Suitable for up to 40 participants."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Events at the Aqua Dome Plaza",
      "html": "<strong>Events at the Aqua Dome Plaza</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Add the Edom Mountains and Red Sea to your special day.",
      "html": "Add the Edom Mountains and Red Sea to your special day."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Make your wedding, barmitzvah or large corporate event all the more memorable with the enchanting atmosphere of the Red Sea. These events have indoor and outdoor space and offer panoramic views.",
      "html": "Make your wedding, barmitzvah or large corporate event all the more memorable with the enchanting atmosphere of the Red Sea. These events have indoor and outdoor space and offer panoramic views."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Not only that but you will be able to add both the Aquadome experience, a stunning and immersive experience and a visit to the heart-racing shark world.",
      "html": "Not only that but you will be able to add both the Aquadome experience, a stunning and immersive experience and a visit to the heart-racing shark world."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Suitable for events of up to 250 people. Cocktail events for up to 350 people.",
      "html": "Suitable for events of up to 250 people. Cocktail events for up to 350 people."
    }
  ],
